{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1321402001:1":{"text":"Hello, ma'am. You must be a local around here. Have you ever heard of the Kaminsky family?","source_cn":"奶奶，你一定是本地人吧！你有没有听说过卡明斯基家族？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x070381AAE442B386","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321402002:1":{"text":"Kaminsky... It sounds familiar...","source_cn":"卡明斯基……这名字好熟悉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x006249AD66BF6C60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321402003:1":{"text":"Oh, I remember. When I was a girl, there were two families in town with the last name Kaminsky.","source_cn":"……哦，我记起来了。我小的时候，镇上还有两家姓卡明斯基的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x319AD95E31F70277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321402004:1":{"text":"But they moved away a long time ago. It was probably before I was ten years old...","source_cn":"不过，他们很早就搬走了，应该都是我十岁之前的事了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AAAE97BA6173ECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1321402004":{"text":"But they moved away a long time ago. It was probably before I was ten years old...","source_cn":"不过，他们很早就搬走了，应该都是我十岁之前的事了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AAAE97BA6173ECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321402005:1":{"text":"Yes, the whole family...","source_cn":"是啊，要不怎么叫举家搬迁哟……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE227461B6ED007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321402006:1":{"text":"If you want to find out more about the Kaminsky family, you could go ask around <style=\"highlight\">near the restaurant</style> in town. I do recall there was a distant relative in the area.","source_cn":"你们是想打听卡明斯基的事？那不如去镇上的<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DBF8BEA339CE338","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321402007:1":{"text":"Let me think... Ah, the <style=\"highlight\">Kalev</style> family. There should still be a few youngsters from that family in town.","source_cn":"嗯，应该是<style=highlight>卡列夫</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x731D92791275723B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321402008:1":{"text":"Thank you so much, ma'am!","source_cn":"我们知道了，谢谢您！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D94F4AA59337B0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu